  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1 - Providing patients with medication needs as needed. 2 - Alleviating the suffering of many patients who need surgical intervention in the field of heart surgery. 3 - Health education for everyone receiving treatment for prevention. 4 - Assisting the Ministry of Health in the host country, which suffers from a shortage of medical staff specialized in the field of heart surgery.</narrative>
